    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Liam Reilly Auctioneers are delighted to present No. 244 Shawbridge, Chambers Park, Kilcock to the open market.\n\nThis attractive 2-bedroom apartment, extending to approximately 60.14 sq.m., comes to the market in good condition throughout and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation in one of Kilcock's most popular residential developments. Featuring a spacious open-plan living area, two balconies, generous bedrooms, excellent storage and the added benefit of designated parking, this property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\n\nThe accommodation has been thoughtfully designed to provide comfortable, low-maintenance living in a highly convenient location.\n\nAccommodation comprises:\n•Open Plan Kitchen & Living Area (6.4m x 4.8m)\n•Balcony\n•Storage Room & Hotpress\n•Bedroom 1 (3.8m x 2.7m) with Ensuite (1.8m x 1.2m) and private Balcony\n•Bedroom 2 (2.9m x 2.5m)\n\nThe dual balconies provide excellent outdoor space, allowing residents to enjoy fresh air and natural light, while the well-planned layout makes this apartment ideal for modern living. Designated parking further enhances the property's convenience.\n\nShawbridge forms part of the highly regarded Chambers Park development, a modern and well-maintained residential community situated just a short stroll from the centre of Kilcock. Renowned for its attractive surroundings and welcoming atmosphere, Chambers Park has become one of the town's most sought-after developments, offering residents a peaceful setting while remaining within easy reach of every convenience.\n\nKilcock continues to be one of North Kildare's most desirable commuter towns, boasting an excellent range of local amenities including supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, schools, crèches, pharmacies, boutiques, sporting clubs and a thriving community. The nearby Royal Canal Greenway offers scenic walking and cycling routes, while the university town of Maynooth is only a short drive away, providing an even greater choice of shopping, dining and leisure facilities.\n\nFor commuters, the location is exceptional. Kilcock Train Station is within walking distance and offers regular rail services to Dublin City Centre and beyond. The nearby M4 motorway provides easy access to Maynooth, Leixlip, Lucan, Dublin and westbound routes, while a number of regular bus services make daily commuting simple and convenient.\n\nCombining spacious accommodation, designated parking, excellent transport links and an enviable location within a well-established development, No. 244 Shawbridge represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of County Kildare's most sought-after locations.\n\nFeatures: \n•Approx. 60.14 sq.m.\n•Spacious 2-bedroom apartment\n•Presented in good condition throughout\n•Bright open-plan kitchen/living area\n•Two private balconies\n•Master bedroom with ensuite\n•Excellent storage\n•Designated parking\n•Walking distance to Kilcock town centre and train station\n•Easy access to the M4 motorway\n•Ideal for first-time buyers, investors or those looking to downsize\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended through the sole selling agents Liam Reilly Auctioneers.\n\nLIAM REILLY AUCTIONEERS give notice that all descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them.\n\n"
      },
